				<u>Ph.</u>
				325
			</span></i> (lyr.), <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ach.</u>
				418
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>rent,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δι᾽ ἱματίων . . οἷον τ. ἐποίησεν</span>”
